# Design stack

One package that equips every agent on this machine for professional web design:
Astra and Codex (Windows app and WSL CLI), Claude (desktop app and WSL), and any
NormalAI that follows `/ai/governance/README.md`.

Installed 2026-09-22 under governance record `CR-20260922T164807Z-CLAUDE-3KX6H598`.

## Principle

Design decisions belong to whichever AI Mo asks for the work; a lead makes
them on work it leads, and Mo is above everyone. Skills are instruments: vocabulary, references and checks. One
creative-direction skill (Impeccable) plus specialists underneath it, never a
pile of competing "make it pretty" rulebooks. `DESIGN.md` and `PRODUCT.md` in
each project are the visual and product contract.

