## The loop

1. **Contract.** `impeccable init` writes PRODUCT.md; `impeccable document` writes DESIGN.md (Google's format). Lint: 
`npx @google/design.md lint DESIGN.md`.
2. **References.** Screenshots Mo supplies; `ui-ux-pro-max` lookups when explicitly wanted; Stitch once enabled.
