## Codex 1 (Windows) - CREW-QUATERNIUS-F - Phase 1 delivered

Eight crew: mira, noor, rosa, tess, ana, lise, ines, tove. Seven Superhero_Female bases; Rosa uses Superhero_Male 
because the portrait reads male. CC0 Quaternius Universal Base Characters; no new clothing meshes. The supplied 
whole-body surface is partitioned into Skin (head/neck/hands/fingers) and one flat role-coloured Suit placeholder. 
Hair/Eyes/Brows are independent material slots. Hair and replacement matching brows are rigid children of the original 
Head bone; the accessory skeletons are discarded and the original body skeleton is retained. The original eye mesh and 
supplied iris/sclera texture are preserved with a dark recoloured iris.

### Art and substitutions

Skin and hair swatches were sampled from the actual art108 PNGs using the recorded contact positions in 
female-palette.json. Mira's fair skin is an explicit Mo override compensating the warm orange portrait lighting. Skin 
textures are colour-modulated copies of the supplied diffuse, preserving facial and hand detail. Eyes retain the 
supplied white sclera, pupil and highlight instead of becoming a single flat dark surface. Hair is matte solid colour. 
The whole native body scale, rig and weights are untouched; these are human-height bases, not the retired 0.95 m crew 
proportions.

